{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Sweeping Blade|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Yasuo
|skill        = E
|icon         = Sweeping Blade.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Yasuo}} {{tip|dashes}} in the target enemy's direction, dealing {{as|magic damage}},  briefly becoming {{tip|ghosted}}, and generating a stack of ''Ride the Wind'' for a few seconds, stacking up to a cap.
|blurb2      = ''Sweeping Blade'' cannot be cast on the same target for a period.
|blurb4      = {{sbc|Ride the Wind:}} Each stack increases ''Sweeping Blade's'' damage.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Yasuo''' {{tip|dashes}} a fixed distance in the direction of the target enemy and becomes {{tip|ghosted}} for 2 seconds, refreshing on subsequent casts. Upon impact, he deals {{as|magic damage}} to the target and generates a stack of ''Ride the Wind'' for 5 seconds, which refreshes on subsequent hits and stacks up to 4 times.
|leveling     = {{st|Magic Damage|{{ap|70 to 130}} {{as|(+ 20% '''bonus''' AD)}} {{as|(+ 60% AP)}}}}
|description2 = {{sbc|Ride the Wind:}} ''Sweeping Blade's'' damage is increased by 25% per stack, up to {{ap|25*4}}% at maximum stacks.
|leveling2    = {{st|Bonus Damage per Stack|{{ap|70*0.25 to 130*0.25}} {{as|(+ {{ap|20*0.25}}% '''bonus''' AD)}} {{as|(+ {{ap|60*0.25}}% AP)}}|Maximum Bonus Damage|{{ap|70 to 130}} {{as|(+ 20% '''bonus''' AD)}} {{as|(+ 60% AP)}}|Total Combined Damage|{{ap|70*2 to 130*2}} {{as|(+ {{ap|20*2}}% '''bonus''' AD)}} {{as|(+ {{ap|60*2}}% AP)}}}}
|description3 = ''Sweeping Blade'' can be cast on the same target only once every few seconds.
|description4 = '''''Yasuo''' will be {{tip|knockdown|knocked down}} by any {{tip|immobilize|immobilizing}} or {{tip|polymorph|polymorphing}} crowd control during the dash.''
|description5 = ''{{ai|Last Breath|Yasuo}} can be cast during the dash.''
|cooldown     = {{tt|{{ap|0.5 to 0.1}}|Starts after the dash ends}}
|cdstart      = post-effect
|ontargetcdstatic= {{tt|{{ap|10 to 6}}|Starts upon starting the dash}}
|target range = {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} 475
|range        = {{dv|{{tt|475|Dash distance}}|{{tt|625|Maximum increased dash distance across terrain}}}}
|cast time    = none
|queue time   = {{fd|0.5}}
|targeting    = Unit
|affects      = Self, Enemies
|speed        = 750 + {{as|60% movement speed}}
|damagetype   = Magic
|spellshield  = True
|spelleffects = Single target
|projectile   = 
|callforhelp  = True
|grounded     = True
|knockdown    = True
|terraingrace = true
|notes        = 
* If {{ai|Steel Tempest|Yasuo}} has been buffered, {{ai|Wind Wall|Yasuo}} may also be cast during the dash.{{bug|2}}
* ''Sweeping Blade'' will generate {{fd|7.5}} {{tip|Flow}} stacks per cast that travels the maximum distance.
* '''Yasuo''' can use ''Sweeping Blade's'' fixed dash distance to cross walls both before and after hitting his target (provided his proximity to the wall and/or target allows it).
* After ''Sweeping Blade'', '''Yasuo''' becomes {{tip|ghosted}} for a moment to prevent situations where he would face extreme cases of body block.
* {{tip|Sleep}} does not count for knocking the dash down.{{bug}}
}}

