{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Wind Becomes Lightning|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Xin Zhao
|skill        = W
|icon         = Wind Becomes Lightning.png
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Xin Zhao''' unleashes {{tt|4 slashes|First slash happens on-cast instantly, while the remaining 3 are applied every 0.05 seconds thereafter}} in an arc over the first {{fd|0.15}} seconds of the cast time, each dealing {{as|physical damage}} to enemies within. After the remaining cast time, he then thrusts his spear in a line in the target direction, dealing {{as|physical damage}} to enemies hit, increased by {{as|{{pp|key=%|key1=%|type=critical strike chance|0 to 33.3 for 11|0 to 100|formula=0.33 * critical strike chance}}|critical chance}}, and {{tip|slow|slowing}} them by 50% for {{fd|1.5}} {{as|(+ {{fd|0.5}} per 100 AP)}} seconds. ''Wind Becomes Lightning'' deals {{pp|50 to 100 for 16|key=%}} damage to {{tip|minions}}.<br><br>The farthest {{tip|champion}} or large {{tip|monster}} hit within the thrust's area is also marked as ''{{ai|Challenged|Xin Zhao|border=false}}'' and is {{tip|standard sight|revealed}} for 3 seconds.
|leveling    = {{st|Physical Damage per Slash|{{ap|30/4 to 70/4}} {{as|(+ {{ap|30/4}}% AD)}}|Slash Total Physical Damage|{{ap|30 to 70}} {{as|(+ 30% AD)}}}}
{{st|Thrust Physical Damage|{{ap|50 to 190}} {{as|(+ 90% AD)}} {{as|(+ 65% AP)}}}}
{{st|Total Physical Damage|{{ap|30+50 to 70+190}} {{as|(+ 120% AD)}} {{as|(+ 65% AP)}}}}
|description2 = ''Wind Becomes Lightning's'' damage {{tip|healing|heals}} '''Xin Zhao''' for {{fd|33.{{recurring|3}}}}% of his {{as|{{sti|life steal}}}}.
|description3 = ''The durations of {{ai|Three Talon Strike|Xin Zhao}} and {{ais|Audacious Charge|Xin Zhao}} {{as|'''bonus''' attack speed}} are delayed relative to Wind Becomes Lightning's cast time. <br>'''Xin Zhao''' {{tip|sight|reveals}} himself during the cast if there is an enemy champion {{tt|nearby|see details}}''.
|angle        = {{tip|er|icononly = true}} 160º
|effect radius= {{dv|{{tip|er|icononly = true}} {{tt|275|Slash semi-circle radius}}|{{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|125|Slash and thrust extra check radius}}}}
|range        = {{dv|{{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|1000|Thrust range}}|{{tip|er|icononly = true}} {{tt|940|Maximum possible range; See notes}}}}
|speed        = {{tt|6250|Thrust missile speed}}
|width        = {{tip|er|icononly = true}} {{tt|80|Thrust missile width}}
|cost         = 60
|costtype     = Mana
|cooldown     = {{ap|12 to 8}}
|cast time    = {{fd|0.5}}
|queue time   = {{fd|0.3}}
|targeting    = Direction
|affects      = Enemies
|damagetype   = Physical
|spellshield  = true
|spelleffects = Area of effect
|projectile   = False
|grounded     = 
|knockdown    = 
|notes        =
* {{pending for test}} The self-reveal has not been fully tested for complete confirmation. Is the ability invisible when hitting minions and there is no enemy champion nearby? Is the tip of the ability enough to reveal him? Whether it can hit a minion or not? Just if he's around the exit of the fog of war, and even if he points towards the inside of the fog of war? [https://youtu.be/GvLedSeuQ0s]
* {{tip|Spell shield}} will block both the slashes and the thrust.
** If the spell shield blocks the first, or {{tt|sometimes|inconsistent}} the second slash, it will block the rest of the ability, including the thrust. If it is activated after the first slash, it will only block up to 2 slashes and will not block the trust.{{bug}}
{{Effect at cast time end}}
** The thrust will occur from wherever '''Xin Zhao''' is at the end of the cast time.
** The slashes will occur from wherever '''Xin Zhao''' is at the time during the first {{fd|0.15}} seconds.
* ''Wind Becomes Lightning'' maintains its casting angle direction in relation to '''Xin Zhao''' if he moves during the cast time.
** The direction of the slashes will not move during the cast time.
* The first strike's hitbox includes a {{tip|er|icononly = true}} 275 radius 160° cone in front of '''Xin Zhao''' and an additional {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} 125 radius around him.
* The second strike's hitbox includes the same {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} 125 radius around '''Xin Zhao''', a missile with {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} 1000 range and {{tip|er|icononly = true}} 80 total width, and a {{tip|er|icononly = true}} -60 radius area check upon the end of the missile.
** The 125 radius check does not hit [[champion summoned units]].{{bug|2}}
* Because ''Wind Becomes Lightning'' uses an older type of 'healing based on life steal' and not ''{{tip|applies life steal}}'', {{ii|Spirit Visage}} will amplify the life gain twice (+25% life steal and +25% healing), for a total of +{{fd|56.25}}%.<!--PFT: Still true?-->
* Each of ''Wind Becomes Lightning's'' slashes are applied in a separate damage instance from each other.
** This causes effects like {{ri|Bone Plating}} to be applied twice and {{iis|Black Cleaver}} {{nie|Carve}} to be applied multiple times.
<!--Blurb-->
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Xin Zhao}} slashes in an arc, then thrusts his spear in a line in the target direction. Each strike deals {{as|physical damage}} to enemies hit and heals '''Xin Zhao''' based on his {{as|{{sti|life steal}}}}.
|blurb2      = The thrust deals increased damage based on {{as|{{sti|critical strike chance}}}} and briefly {{tip|slows}} enemies hit, enemy {{tip|champions}} or {{tip|monsters}} hit are also {{tip|standard sight|revealed}} and marked [[File:Xin Zhao Challenged Mark.png|24px|link=]]{{as|Challenged|buzzword}} for a short time.
}}
